  "notes": "USAGE:\nPrimarily used for preventing diseases, health problems, and disasters. The noun form {予防|よぼう} is equally common and frequently appears in compounds.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {病気|びょうき}を{予防|よぼう}する (to prevent illness)\n- {感染|かんせん}を{予防|よぼう}する (to prevent infection)\n- {予防|よぼう}{接種|せっしゅ} (vaccination)\n- {予防|よぼう}{策|さく} (preventive measure)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {防止|ぼうし}する: to prevent, to check — more formal, used for regulations and institutional measures\n- {防|ふせ}ぐ: to prevent, to defend against — native Japanese verb, broader usage",
